{"id":"52376918bee1945e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-tred.md","title":"Turing 可约","display":"df-tred — Turing 可约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-tred","aliases":["20-df-tred"],"display":"df-tred — Turing 可约","chapter":"3","section":"3.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[89],"source_printed_pages":[53],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-tred"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-tred</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tred — Turing 可约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tred}\\vdash\nA\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n[\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_A(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tred}\\vdash\nA\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n[\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_A(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>要求输出对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 都存在且属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\le_TB\">\\(f\\le_TB\\)</span> 时，另指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是全函数且属于相对可计算函数族；这是函数版本的明确约定。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.2.2；印刷页 53；PDF 第 89 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numberin